cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use StowSim in your research, please cite it using the metadata below."
title: "StowSim: A Physics-Based Simulation Benchmark for Online and Offline 3-D Baggage Stowage"
type: software
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-10-30
license: MIT
authors:
  - family-names: "Ali"
    given-names: "Zulqarnain"
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0009-0281-882X"
    affiliation: "Yeungnam University, Daegu, Republic of Korea"
    email: "zulqar445ali@gmail.com"
keywords:
  - 3-D bin packing
  - baggage stowage
  - physics simulation
  - online packing
  - benchmark
abstract: >-
  StowSim simulates the loading of cuboid bags into side-opening air-cargo containers with
  physics-validated placements (inclusion, insertion path, settling). It supports online stowage
  with a limited look-ahead pool and offline sequencing, soft and priority bags, shelves and
  multiple containers, and ships a reference agent and development tools.
